  "title": "Upwork to Report First Quarter Financial Results on May 7, 2026",
  "summary": "PALO ALTO, Calif., April 14, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Upwork Inc. (Nasdaq: UPWK), the world’s human and AI-powered work marketplace, today announced that it will report its financial results for the first quarter of 2026 on Thursday, May 7, 2026 after market close.",
